  "details": "VRCSDK3-WORLD-2021.05.17.12.52_Public\nUdon Graph\nbuild number 1097.\nSeems that each time I build and test the world or even publish, The udon graph stops working completely after the 2nd time, but the first time it works fine but then 2nd it starts breaking and 3rd, its no longer useable. \nUse Trigger enter, Use Animator-setbool, Use VRCPlayerAPI with Get is Local and UnaryNegation and connect it to animator-setbool with the animator connected to animator-setbool. and then have another one but with a different trigger exit with everything being the same then run the map a couple of times.",
